msgid "Balance Bot SITL/MAVProxy Tutorial"
msgstr "Balance Bot SITL（软件在环仿真）/MAVProxy 教程"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:7
#: 1603e314e38f4d9d92ed2f8d94354167
msgid ""
"If you are new to using SITL, please follow these "
":ref:`instructions<setting-up-sitl-on-linux>` to setup SITL. For executing "
"SITL balance bot, navigate to the ardupilot/Rover directory on terminal and "
"execute the command:"
msgstr ""
"如果您是第一次使用 SITL（软件在环仿真），请按照 :ref:`instructions<setting-up-sitl-on-linux>` "
"中的说明搭建 SITL（软件在环仿真）。要执行 SITL（软件在环仿真）平衡机器人，请在终端中进入 ardupilot/Rover 目录并执行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:13
#: 2f83f97891fe4e54aea45bd8248b25a4
msgid ""
"The vehicle should start in Manual Mode. You can now move it around using "
"the mavproxy's rc override commands. rc3 is throttle and rc1 is yaw."
msgstr "飞行器应在手动模式下启动。现在可以使用 mavproxy 的 RC 覆盖命令移动它。rc3 是油门，rc1 是偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:15
#: a7dd6b1e9c4f48478ed69bf23a240c65
msgid ""
"If you are not familiar with using mavproxy commands, please refer to the "
":ref:`MAVProxy documentation <mavproxy:home>` or this quick "
":ref:`guide<using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您不熟悉 mavproxy 命令，请参阅 :ref:`MAVProxy documentation <mavproxy:home>` 或本快速 "
":ref:`guide<using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`。"
